prompt_text:
Please read [working-notes.md](projects/ideas-study/working-notes.md) .&#x20;

One thing I'd like to add: this story is too long at the moment. It could usefully be about 2/3 of its current size. Its ambition remains the same -- to trace the threads of the ideas from ancient times to modern, and I don't want to loose that. What that means is that we have to figure out which places are justified by either (1) being important to connections, or (2) being important ends in their own right.

I'd like you to make changes, based on the recommendation there and my own feedback above. Once you're done, evaluate your changes with another --fast playthrough per [story-authoring.md](docs/story-authoring.md)  and [fun-and-evaluation.md](docs/fun-and-evaluation.md) . And once you've done that, do one further similar cycle of iteration. Thank you!
